        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0101_TalkTo_Cultist01",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"I am looking for someone, actually.\"",
        "NPCResponse": "Oh? Well, I am afraid I cannot help you there. I arrived only this morning and I do not know a single name!",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0101_TalkTo_Cultist02",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Will any other newcomers be there?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "Well… we did have one young woman at our table last night, but I am not certain if she will choose to stay. If you ask me, she seemed rather attached to her mother.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0101_TalkTo_Cultist03",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Have you met Han Liu?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "I have. Is she a friend of yours? You might want to speak to the High Seer if you would like to join her. I believe she departed for her walk in the dark hours of the morning.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0101_TalkTo_CultOfficer",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"I am looking for Han Liu.\"",
        "NPCResponse": "Ah, Miss Liu. A promising young spark, that one. She walks the path of truth now. If she returns, I am sure she will be glad to see you after such a trial.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0102_TalkTo_CultOfficer_Pilgrimmage",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"I'm ready to learn more.\"",
        "NPCResponse": "I can tell you, or you can see for yourself. Follow the path to the north as it mounts the peak.",
