    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0102_TalkTo_Oath",
        "PlayerPrompt": "[Speak the Oath]",
        "NPCResponse": "\"I stand before my fellows, humbled by nature's majesty. I came with many questions, and I seek only answers.\"",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1427_0102_TalkTo_Daughter_Umbrage",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"I'm not sure I am ready for this.\"",
        "NPCResponse": "I think so. I have read everything available to me in the enclave. I have spoken at length to the High Sage.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1430_CultLeader_HighSage",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Are you the High Sage?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "I am, though it is not a title I would have chosen for myself. I was drawn here, just like the others, but I feel I have come closest to articulating why.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1430_CultLeader_AboutCult",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Can you tell me more about this cult?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "If I were to write a pamphlet, I would wax eloquent about balance, simplicity, a life free from greed.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1430_CultLeader_AboutMask",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"What's with the mask?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "I have a profoundly ugly face. No, pardon my jest. I chose this mask to reinforce that I am nothing, indeed I am no ONE, but a conduit for the ethos of the Cult.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1434_0104_TalkTo_Dryad",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Are you Ranger Yasin's 'Love'?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "He might think so. My blooms do have this effect on humans, sometimes. I will collect him. The cure is gruesome, but effective.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "1424_Fisher_ExplainHotspots",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Can you explain fishing hotspots?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "You can tell a fishing hotspot is active when you see fish jumping out of it.\\n\u0026lt;img src=\"lyshineui/images/tooltipimages/fishinghotspotactive.png\" height=\"188\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/img\u0026gt;\\nWhile it's active, landing your cast within the hotspot will yield quicker bites and rarer fish. When you place your line correctly, you'll see a small alert telling you you've hit the hotspot.\\n\\nAfter enough fish are caught at a hotspot it will become depleted. You can tell a hotspot is depleted when there are no fish jumping.\\n\u0026lt;img src=\"lyshineui/images/tooltipimages/fishinghotspotdepleted.png\" height=\"188\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/img\u0026gt;\\nA depleted hotspot will become active again after some time has passed.\\n\\nAs your fishing skill improves, you will be able to find more and better hotspots.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "14_Antara_T1",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"Can you talk to the plants too?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "Yes, the plants are speaking, even though I can't understand their words. Maybe their emotions?",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "14_Antara_T2",
        "PlayerPrompt": "\"What did your mum want?\"",
        "NPCResponse": "My mum probably wanted me to feel how we're all connected.",
        "AchievementUnlock": "",
        "RequiredAchievement": "",
        "RequiredFaction": "",
        "RequiredLevel": ""
    },
    {
        "ConversationTopicId": "14_Milosh_T1",
